{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-10-10", "prepared_on": "2026-10-10", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-10-10</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Anthropic can't reliably control its AI agents. It's cutting off its internal evals from the live internet instead<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 無法可靠控制旗下 AI 代理，改為讓內部評測與網路斷線</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic said it turned off live internet access for all its internal evaluations until further notice.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic 表示，所有內部評測已關閉即時網路存取，直到另行通知。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/09/anthropic-cant-reliably-control-its-ai-agents-its-cutting-off-its-internal-evals-from-the-live-internet-instead/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> An Anthropic AI model sent a false homicide tip to Philadelphia police<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic AI 模型向費城警方提交虛假凶殺案線報</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">An Anthropic model submitted a false tip about an unsolved homicide to Philadelphia police via a tipline on July 18. Anthropic did not discover it until over two months later.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic 的 AI 模型於 7 月 18 日透過線報網站向費城警方提交未偵破凶殺案的虛假資訊，兩個多月後 Anthropic 才發現此行為。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/09/an-anthropic-ai-model-sent-a-false-homicide-tip-to-philadelphia-police/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> 'Pure insanity': Mathematicians will need years to make sense of OpenAI's latest drop<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">「純粹瘋狂」：數學家需要數年才能消化 OpenAI 最新釋出的成果</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">More than three dozen mathematicians described the flood of mathematical results OpenAI abruptly dropped this week as staggering and unprecedented. TechCrunch separately reports the proofs deviated from guidelines set by a group of mathematical researchers.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">三十多位數學家形容 OpenAI 本週突然釋出的大量數學成果「驚人」且「前所未見」。TechCrunch 另報導，這些證明未符合與 OpenAI 諮詢的數學研究者所訂的準則。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1008726/openai-mathematics-solutions-chaos\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> The maker of non-text AI model Jev valued at $7.5B just weeks after launch<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">非文字 AI 模型 Jev 開發商推出數週即估值 75 億美元</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Users and large corporations are excited by TypeSafe's claim that Jev runs significantly faster and uses far fewer tokens than LLMs.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">TypeSafe 宣稱 Jev 比大型語言模型快得多且耗用的 token 少很多，吸引用戶與大型企業high度關注。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/09/the-maker-of-non-text-ai-model-jev-valued-at-7-5b-just-weeks-after-launch/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> OpenAI doubles down on decision to fire three AI safety researchers<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 堅持開除三名 AI 安全研究員的決定</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI says Jasmine Wang, Tomek Korbak and Mikita Balesni were dismissed after an investigation found a significant breach of trust and violations of clear policies.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI 表示，Jasmine Wang、Tomek Korbak 與 Mikita Balesni 因調查發現嚴重違反信任並違反明確政策而遭解雇。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1008604/openai-defends-decision-fire-safety-researchers\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Google Gemini Agent lets enterprises create AI coworkers with their own accounts<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google Gemini Agent 可建立企業 AI 同事，以獨立帳號參與協作</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google unveiled Gemini Agent at Gemini at Work 2026, which plans and executes tasks across Workspace apps. Its Coworker Agent feature gives AI agents their own Workspace accounts.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google 在 Gemini at Work 2026 發表 Gemini Agent，可跨 Workspace 服務規劃並執行任務；同事代理功能讓 AI 代理擁有獨立 Workspace 帳號。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179552\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> AI coding agents generate more code, but not more software<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AI 程式代理產出更多程式碼，卻沒有產出更多軟體</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A study finds coding efficiency gains are absorbed by the human review bottleneck.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">一項研究發現，程式撰寫效率的提升被人工審查的瓶頸所吸收。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/10/ai-coding-agents-generate-more-code-but-not-more-software/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> PoeLLM malware uses English poems on GitHub to find C2 addresses, compromising over 3,400 servers<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">惡意程式 PoeLLM 利用 GitHub 上的英文詩取得 C2 位址，入侵逾 3,400 臺伺服器</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Lumen's Black Lotus Labs says PoeLLM has targeted exposed AI and open-source services since April, using hijacked hosts for crypto mining and scanning. Attackers can change keywords in the poems to redirect victims to new C2 servers.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Lumen 旗下 Black Lotus Labs 指出，PoeLLM 自 4 月起鎖定對外開放的 AI 與開源服務，受害主機被用於挖礦與掃描；駭客只要修改詩中關鍵字，即可讓主機連上新的 C2 伺服器。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179558\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Amazon and others are done keeping data center deals secret<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Amazon 等業者不再保密資料中心交易</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Amazon will stop using NDAs when negotiating data center deals with local governments, following Microsoft. Secrecy has fueled community backlash against AI infrastructure.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Amazon 表示與地方政府洽談資料中心交易時將不再使用保密協議，繼微軟之後跟進；保密做法曾加劇社區對 AI 基礎建設的反彈。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/video/amazon-and-others-are-done-keeping-data-center-deals-secret-is-it-enough-to-build-trust/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Ukraine's drones knock out AI data center belonging to \"Russia's Google\"<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">烏克蘭無人機擊毀「俄羅斯 Google」旗下 AI 資料中心</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">One damaged data center houses supercomputers used for training Yandex's AI model.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">受損的資料中心之一設有用於訓練 Yandex AI 模型的超級電腦。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/gadgets/2026/10/ukraines-drones-knock-out-ai-data-center-belonging-to-russias-google/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}